{"id":101,"verses":[{"number":1,"arabicText":"ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Al-qāriʿat","translation":"The Striking Calamity -"},{"number":2,"arabicText":"مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Mā l-qāriʿat","translation":"What is the Striking Calamity?"},{"number":3,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْقَارِعَةُ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā l-qāriʿat","translation":"And what can make you know what is the Striking Calamity?"},{"number":4,"arabicText":"يَوْمَ يَكُونُ ٱلنَّاسُ كَٱلْفَرَاشِ ٱلْمَبْثُوثِ","transliteration":"Yawma yakūnu n-nāsu kal-farāshi l-mabthūth","translation":"It is the Day when people will be like moths, dispersed,"},{"number":5,"arabicText":"وَتَكُونُ ٱلْجِبَالُ كَٱلْعِهْنِ ٱلْمَنفُوشِ","transliteration":"Watakūnu l-jibālu kal-ʿih'ni l-manfūsh","translation":"And the mountains will be like wool, fluffed up."},{"number":6,"arabicText":"فَأَمَّا مَن ثَقُلَتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Fa-ammā man thaqulat mawāzīnuh","translation":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],"},{"number":7,"arabicText":"فَهُوَ فِى عِيشَةٍۢ رَّاضِيَةٍۢ","transliteration":"Fahuwa fī ʿīshatir-rāḍiyatin","translation":"He will be in a pleasant life."},{"number":8,"arabicText":"وَأَمَّا مَنْ خَفَّتْ مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","transliteration":"Wa-ammā man khaffat mawāzīnuh","translation":"But as for one whose scales are light,"},{"number":9,"arabicText":"فَأُمُّهُۥ هَاوِيَةٌۭ","transliteration":"Fa-ummuhu hāwiyatun","translation":"His refuge will be an abyss."},{"number":10,"arabicText":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا هِيَهْ","transliteration":"Wamā adrāka mā hiyah","translation":"And what can make you know what that is?"},{"number":11,"arabicText":"نَارٌ حَامِيَةٌۢ","transliteration":"Nārun ḥāmiyatun","translation":"It is a Fire, intensely hot."}]}